== Frontend (frontend/, embedded in the binary as web/dist) ==

The web UI bundle includes 40 npm packages (production dependencies,
transitively): 25 MIT, 11 ISC, 1 BSD-3-Clause, 1 Unlicense, 2 OFL-1.1 (fonts) — no copyleft.
The package-by-package list is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. Their license texts
are in each package under frontend/node_modules after `bun install`, and in the
container image under /usr/share/doc/graph/licenses/npm.

Fonts are bundled locally (no third-party font CDN) under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1: Instrument Sans (Copyright 2022 The Instrument Sans Project
Authors) and JetBrains Mono (Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project
Authors), via the @fontsource-variable packages, which ship the OFL text.
